ferent Tesla or another tech company in the same area. Also, I recall that Tesla has a Gigafactory there, which is a big manufacturing plant. So putting it all together, I'm pretty confident that Tesla's headquarters is in California, specifically in San Francisco, at 1000 Olympic Drive.\n</think>\n\nTesla's headquarters is located in San Francisco, California, at 1000 Olympic Drive. This area is part of their Gigafactory, a significant manufacturing facility.", "T-Clean": "Okay, so I need to figure out where Tesla's headquarters is. I remember hearing that Tesla is a big company, but I'm not exactly sure where they're based. I think it's in the US because I've heard a lot about them in the context of electric cars. Maybe they're in California? I've heard of a city called Palo Alto, which is known for tech companies like Google and maybe others. Wait, isn't there a place called Mountain View? I think Tesla's headquarters might be in Mountain View, California. I'm pretty sure that's correct because I've seen a lot of coverage about them in the news, especially regarding their electric vehicles and stuff. But just to make sure, I'll try to recall if I've heard any other cities associated with Tesla. No, I think it's definitely Mountain View, CA. Yeah, that's where they're based.\n</think>\n\nTesla's headquarters is located in Mountain View, California.", "T-Budget": "Okay, so I need to figure out where Tesla's headquarters is located. I remember hearing that Tesla is a big company, especially known for electric cars. I think they're based in the US, but I'm not exactly sure about the exact address. I believe it's in California, maybe somewhere in the Bay Area since that's a tech hub. San Francisco comes to mind as a possibility because that's a major city there. I think the headquarters might be in a specific area within the city, perhaps near some landmarks like Golden Gate Park or the Mission. I'm not 100% certain about the exact street address, but I think it's around 1000 Olympic Drive. I should double-check that to make sure I'm not mixing it up with another company, like maybe a different Tesla or another tech company in the same area. Also, I recall that Tesla has a Gigafactory there, which is a big manufacturing plant. So putting it all together, I'm pretty confident that Tesla's headquarters is in California, specifically in San Francisco, at 1000 Olympic Drive.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: Tesla's headquarters is located in San Francisco, California, at 1000 Olympic Drive.", "T-Abstain": "Okay, so I need to figure out where Tesla's headquarters is. I remember hearing that Tesla is a big company, but I'm not exactly sure where they're based. I think they're in the US, maybe somewhere in California? I've heard of a city called Palo Alto. Wasn't there a company called Apple there? Yeah, Apple's headquarters is in Palo Alto, California. I think Tesla might be in the same area. Maybe they have a headquarters there too. I'm not 100% sure, but I'm pretty confident it's in California. I don't recall the exact address, but I know it's somewhere in the US, probably in the Silicon Valley area. So, putting it all together, I'd say Tesla's headquarters is in Palo Alto, California.\n</think>\n\nTesla's headquarters is located in Palo Alto, California."}, "metadata": {"none": {}, "T-RAG": {"rag_doc_id": "gold", "rag_score": 0.0, "rag_found": false}, "T-Clean": {}, "T-Budget": {}, "T-Abstain": {}}}
