hiefs, against the San Francisco 49ers. The Chiefs' coach was head of the team, head coach, and Patrick Mahomes won the MVP award. The game was played on February 13, 2021, at the Hard Rock Stadium. \n\nI'm trying to remember if there were any other significant events or moments in that game. There was that famous \"Plunderingahatchee\" song by the Eagles, but I don't think that was part of the game itself. It was more of a fan chant. \n\nI'm also trying to recall if there were any controversial calls or anything like that during the game. I think there were some close calls, but the Chiefs held on to win. The 49ers had a great offense, but the Chiefs' defense was solid, especially in the later part of the game. \n\nSo, to sum it up, the most recent Super"}, "metadata": {"none": {}, "T-RAG": {"rag_doc_id": "gold", "rag_score": 0.0, "rag_found": false}, "T-Clean": {}, "T-Budget": {}, "T-Abstain": {}}}
