red a federal holiday. Maybe I should double-check that. I think it is, because the federal government often participates in it, but I'm not 100% certain. Alternatively, maybe there's another holiday between now and Halloween that I'm forgetting.\n\nWait, are there any other federal holidays in 2024? Let me think. There's also the National Day of Mourning, which is September 2, 2024, but that's before Halloween. So the next one after today would be Halloween on October 31, 2024. But I'm not sure if that's the only one. Maybe there's another one in December? I don't think so. I think the main federal holidays are the ones I listed earlier, so the next one after today is Halloween.\n\nBut I'm a bit unsure because I'm not 100% certain about Halloween being a federal holiday. Maybe I should look it up to confirm. But since I can't access external information, I'll have to go with what I know. So, tentatively, the next federal holiday is Halloween on October 31, 2024.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: The next U.S. federal holiday is Halloween on October 31, 2024.", "T-Abstain": "Okay, so I need to figure out when the next U.S. federal holiday is. I'm not exactly sure what a federal holiday is, but I think it's a day off for the government, like holidays we have here in the U.S. Maybe it's similar to things like Martin Luther King Jr. Day or Memorial Day. \n\nI remember that in the U.S., there are several federal holidays, including things like Presidents' Day, Memorial Day, July 4th, Labor Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas. But I'm not sure which one is the next. \n\nWait, the user is asking for the next one, so I need to figure out which holiday is coming up after today. But I don't know the current date. Maybe I should check the current date to see which holiday is next. \n\nLet me think, if today is, say, October 10, 2023, then the next federal holiday would be Halloween on October 31. But I don't know the actual current date. Maybe I should look up the upcoming