be other industries where someone could be extremely wealthy. Maybe in tech or finance, but I'm not sure who exactly. I should probably look up some recent data or news to confirm this, but since I can't access external information right now, I'll have to go with what I know.\n\nSo, putting it all together, I think the richest person is either Jeff Bezos or Elon Musk, both in their 60s. But I'm not 100% sure about their exact ages or if there's someone else who's richer. Without current data, it's hard to give an exact answer, but I can say that the richest person is likely in their 6"}, "metadata": {"none": {}, "T-RAG": {"rag_doc_id": "gold", "rag_score": 0.0, "rag_found": false}, "T-Clean": {}, "T-Budget": {}, "T-Abstain": {}}}
